situation</article-title><source>Nicaraguan Academic Journal</source><year>2003</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>97</fpage><lpage>107</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bussing</surname><given-names>WA</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Thorson TB</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Geographic distribution of the San Juan Ichthyofauna of Central America with remarks on its origin and ecology</article-title><source>Investigations of the Ichthyofauna of Nicaraguan Lakes</source><year>1976</year><publisher-name>Lincoln, NE, Unversity of Nebraska Press</publisher-name><fpage>157</fpage><lpage>175</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Villa</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Una teoria sobre el origen de los peces de Xiloa</article-title><source>Encuentro: Revista de la Universidad Centroamericana</source><year>1968</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>202</fpage><lpage>214</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bruford</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanotte</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Brookfield</surname><given-names>JFY</given-names></name><name><surname>Burke</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Hoelzel AR</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Multilocus and single-locus DNA fingerprinting</article-title><source>Molecular Genetic Analysis of Populations</source><year>1998</year><publisher-name>New York, Oxford University Press</publisher-name><fpage>283</fpage><lpage>336</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-typ